  <font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">So you want to add your guild to our database, and maybe join our alliance? That's fine by us, but remember a few things before you add your guild:
  <li>We only accept guilds that follow EVIL gods. That would be Cazic-Thule, Innoruuk, Bertoxxulous, or Rallos-Zek.
  <li>Please do not post vulgar guild names, or they will be deleted.
  <li>Posting your guild here will allow you to enter the alliance between evil guilds that we are organizing.</font> 
